  "description": "•\tConvert the garage to habitable use, restoring the original 4 leaf vertical panelled doors;\n•\tEnlarge the ground floor front window as a three light design with lower sills\n•\tAdd a single storey rear extension under a flat lead roof with new French doors and side windows with lower sills\n•\tInsert a French door in the centre of the rear bay window with lower sills to the ground floor windows\n•\tReplace the side hipped roof and flat roofed wings on the South East side with a two storey projecting wing under a hipped tiled roof with the unstable chimney stack rebuilt all to match the other side of the house with a narrower lead roof side extension to the front and rear \n•\tReplace the two dormer windows with an arched three light dormer centred in the side roof slope.\n•\tInsert a  low skylight in the flat crown roof concealed by the surrounding ridge tiles.\n",
